[en.FOCUS_C12_RECONNECTING_WITH_DISTANT_RELATIVES]
Invite Distant Relatives

[en.FOCUS_C12_RECONNECTING_WITH_DISTANT_RELATIVES_desc]
Some members of the Pie family reside outside the rock farm, and we can invite them back and utilize their expertise to help improve the autonomy of the territory.

